            </note>
            <note corresp="#pm_d12-f2" n="2" xml:id="pm_d12-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#pm_d11">Document PM–11, footnote 2</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#pm_d12-f3" n="3" xml:id="pm_d12-f3-content">
                <p>In telegram 448 from Panama City, April 13, Ambassador Harrington informed the
                    Department of State that he had presented President Eisenhower’s letter to
                    President de la Guardia that morning, and that de la Guardia did not intend to
                    release the text to the press until he had received a further reply from
                    Eisenhower. (611.19/4–1359)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
